{
  "topic_aliases": {
    "工作": "work",
    "差事": "work",
    "搬柴": "work",
    "job": "work"
  },
  "dialogues": [
    {
      "dialogue_id": "dialogue.registration_clerk.default",
      "speaker_id": "npc.registration_clerk",
      "topic": "default",
      "when": [],
      "text": "名字先記在冊上。想在這座城活下去，就別把身份牌弄丟。"
    },
    {
      "dialogue_id": "dialogue.registration_clerk.city",
      "speaker_id": "npc.registration_clerk",
      "topic": "city",
      "when": [],
      "text": "北邊的關卡通往軍營，西邊巷子常有人找零工；先找能讓你站穩腳跟的事。"
    },
    {
      "dialogue_id": "dialogue.foreman_laotie.work.offer",
      "speaker_id": "npc.foreman_laotie",
      "topic": "work",
      "when": [
        {
          "owner": "$actor",
          "namespace": "quest",
          "key": "quest.find_work",
          "equals": "unstarted"
        }
      ],
      "text": "巷子裡有一捆柴薪，替我送來，我付你十五枚銅幣，便算你今天做了第一件正經事。"
    },
    {
      "dialogue_id": "dialogue.foreman_laotie.work.available",
      "speaker_id": "npc.foreman_laotie",
      "topic": "work",
      "when": [
        {
          "owner": "$actor",
          "namespace": "quest",
          "key": "quest.find_work",
          "equals": "available"
        }
      ],
      "text": "柴薪還在巷子裡；帶來之後，我就給你結十五枚銅幣的工錢。"
    },
    {
      "dialogue_id": "dialogue.foreman_laotie.work.completed",
      "speaker_id": "npc.foreman_laotie",
      "topic": "work",
      "when": [
        {
          "owner": "$actor",
          "namespace": "quest",
          "key": "quest.find_work",
          "equals": "completed"
        }
      ],
      "text": "柴薪和十五枚銅幣的工錢都已交割。城裡的路，往後得靠你自己走。"
    },
    {
      "dialogue_id": "dialogue.foreman_laotie.default",
      "speaker_id": "npc.foreman_laotie",
      "topic": "default",
      "when": [],
      "text": "別站著發愣；有手有腳的人，在這裡總能找到一件該做的事。"
    },
    {
      "dialogue_id": "dialogue.checkpoint_guard.default",
      "speaker_id": "npc.checkpoint_guard",
      "topic": "default",
      "when": [],
      "text": "臨時身份牌就是通行資格；有牌便自行打開鐵柵欄。北面是正式軍營，進去後自己留神。"
    },
    {
      "dialogue_id": "dialogue.woerkan.default",
      "speaker_id": "npc.woerkan",
      "topic": "default",
      "when": [],
      "text": "沃爾坎·鐵壁只是看著你，彷彿北境的風雪也在等你先開口。"
    }
  ]
}
